<title>MEXICO: Latam steel product imports by country -ILAFA.</title>
<headline>Latam steel product imports by country -ILAFA.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latin American Insitute of Iron and Steel (ILAFA) outlined here at the Latin American Steel Congress imports of semi-finished and finished steel products by country in the region. A table follows with a breakdown in 1000s of tonnes. The figure for 1996 is preliminary.</p>
<p>  Country	 1994     1995     1996   %Chnge 96/95</p>
<p>  Argentina     1,082	890	694    -22.0</p>
<p>  Brazil	    214	288	340     17.9</p>
<p>  Chile	     452	657	688	4.7</p>
<p>  Colombia	  917    1,034    1,086	5.0</p>
<p>  Mexico	  2,723    1,100	900    -18.2</p>
<p>  Peru		291	460	380    -17.4</p>
<p>  Venezuela	 102	229	151    -34.1</p>
<p>  Others	  1,090    1,100    1,155	5.0</p>
<p>  Total	   6,871    5,758    5,394     -6.3</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530</p>
